   <media:description>Simple, supple, light. 

From the runway to the moments in between, explore the spirit of Nicolas Ghesquière’s Women’s Spring – Summer 2027 Show through the eyes of House Ambassadors and Friends of the House, including Felix, Zendaya, Sophie Turner, Wunmi Mosaku, and more — narrated by Tuba Avalon.

